# MangaTL is freeware, not open source: this repository publishes only the
# readme, the license, the credits and the pictures the readme shows. Every
# other file -- the source, the tests, the models, settings and API keys --
# stays on this computer.
#
# Written as a whitelist rather than a list of things to hide, so a file
# added later is private until it is named here on purpose. To publish a
# new picture, add a `!/docs/images/<name>` line below.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md

!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/images/
/docs/images/*
!/docs/images/preview-app.png
!/docs/images/before-after.png
!/docs/images/logo.png
